WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:41.500
...which was initiated in July this year
through the acceptance -

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:49.000
- of the accession requests by
the United Kingdom and other countries.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:02.500
The decision on the further procedures
will be taken - after consideration -

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:10.500
- at the end of the debate on 18/19 December.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:20.000
This, ladies and gentlemen,
is what I can tell you in short at this moment.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.500
Everybody agreed. There was no opposition.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:52.000
That on the 18/19 December at the end of the debate,
there will be a decision on the further procces.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.000
Are there any other questions, ladies and gentlemen?

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.500
I cannot see any other questions.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.500
Thank you for your interest and your patience.

